\"text\":\"Enter 401(k) contributions (up to $24,500) and HSA contributions to reduce your taxable income.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"View Your Results\",\"text\":\"See your net take-home pay broken down by federal tax, FICA, state tax, and pre-tax deductions with effective tax rate.\"}]},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#itemlist\",\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"name\":\"Free 2026 Tax Calculators\",\"description\":\"67 free tax calculators for 2026 covering paycheck, state tax, mortgage, retirement, and more.\",\"numberOfItems\":67,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Paycheck Calculator\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/paycheck-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Illinois\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/illinois-tax-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Texas\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/texas-tax-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Florida\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/florida-tax-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"California\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/california-tax-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"New York\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/new-york-tax-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"name\":\"Mortgage\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/mortgage-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"name\":\"401(k)\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/401k-retirement-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":9,\"name\":\"Relocate\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/relocation-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":10,\"name\":\"Capital Gains\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/capital-gains-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":11,\"name\":\"Self-Employment\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/self-employment-tax-calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":12,\"name\":\"Sales Tax Calculator\",\"url\":